  "content": {
    "id": "p16-q12-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "12",
    "prompt": "The distance between two towns, $A$ and $B$, is 350 km. Find $x$ if:",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p16-q12-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "the trip takes $x$ hours at an average speed of 80 km/h",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=4\\dfrac{3}{8}$ hours.",
          "worked": "Using distance = average speed × time,\n$$\\begin{align*}80x&=350\\\\x&=\\frac{350}{80}\\\\x&=4\\frac{3}{8}\\end{align*}$$\nThe trip takes $4\\dfrac{3}{8}$ hours.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      },
      {
        "id": "p16-q12-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "the trip takes $3\\dfrac{1}{2}$ hours at an average speed of $x$ km/h",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=100$ km/h.",
          "worked": "Using distance = average speed × time,\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{7}{2}x&=350\\\\x&=350\\times\\frac{2}{7}\\\\x&=100\\end{align*}$$\nThe average speed is 100 km/h.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      },
      {
        "id": "p16-q12-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "the trip takes a total of 3 hours, travelling $x$ hours at 120 km/h and the remaining time at 60 km/h",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
